        }
      ],
      "after": "人"
    },
    {
      "title": "哋 (dei6) makes pronouns plural",
      "explain": "我 (ngo5) → 我哋 (ngo5 dei6) (we), 你 (nei5) → 你哋 (nei5 dei6) (you all), 佢 (keoi5) → 佢哋 (keoi5 dei6) (they). Only pronouns take 哋 (dei6), not nouns.",
