  "toneLesson": {
    "title": "Rising tones: 2 and 5",
    "card": {
      "title": "A big rise and a small rise",
      "explain": "Both tones go up. Tone 2 starts mid and climbs high, like a surprised 'eh?'. Tone 5 starts low and rises only to the middle, a lazy shrug. You already say tone 5 in 我 (ngo5) and 你 (nei5).",
